# /locate 在一个**有结构**的超平坦世界里的行为
#
# 平坦世界的 generator-settings 第 4 段是结构表（village / mineshaft /
# stronghold / oceanmonument / biome_1），第 3 段是生物群系 id。
--- console ---
say N01
locate Stronghold
say N02
locate stronghold
say N03
locate Village
say N04
locate village
say N05
locate VILLAGE
say N06
locate Mineshaft
say N07
locate Temple
say N08
locate Monument
say N09
locate Mansion
say N10
locate EndCity
say N11
locate Fortress
say N12
locate biome plains
say N13
locate Stronghold
say N14
